        "description": "Checks if the python3 serer website at 192.168.1.5:8080 is up or down.",
        "jsCode": "try {\n  // We use n8n's built-in request helper with a 5-second timeout\n  const response = await this.helpers.httpRequest({\n    url: 'http://192.168.1.5:8080',\n    method: 'GET',\n    timeout: 5000 \n  });\n  \n  return \"The website is up and running.\";\n\n} catch (error) {\n  // If the server is down (ECONNREFUSED or Timeout), it falls here instead of crashing\n  return \"The website is down. The connection was refused or timed out.\";\n}"
